The '''Smoker''' is an upgrade for the [[Cauldron]]. It must be built within 5 meters of a Cauldron to connect to it.

== Building ==
The Smoker is built with the [[Hammer]] under the Crafting tab and requires a nearby [[Workbench]]. It costs:
* {{Item link|Bloodgold|5}}
* {{Item link|Timberwood|6}}

== Usage ==
The Smoker is one of the six extensions that raise the [[Cauldron]] up to level 7. Level 7 Cauldron items include:
* {{Item link|Fish Soup}}
* {{Item link|Meat In Bread}}
* {{Item link|Meatballs and Poteitr}}
* {{Item link|Seal Meat Soup}}
* {{Item link|Smoked Fish}}
* {{Item link|Smoked Moose Meat}}
* {{Item link|Unbaked Poteitr}}

* For other upgrades, see [[Cauldron]].

